notes.body:
@SYN-bit @stigbjorlykke take a look let me know what you think. 

I've put all entries to their own column. the separator is configurable. There is an option to either click the link, or shift+ctrl+click. Added ability to adjust the font/emoji size in relation to the size of the row. to address the scope issue, I made to where you can choose which profile you're editing. When you open tag rules dialog it's configuring you're current profile. But you can choose any other profile, so that you can go through each profile config without having to change hte profile in the main window. This also allowed me to add a "global" option in the selector (if you're ok with it). I messed around with allowing different text fonts. But ended up landing on the Font that's defined in the theme setting. So it matches the font of the other columns now. Looking forward to your feedback on this one.

![image](/uploads/2e9e5be2242c334d06163284a45761bb/image.png){width=900 height=458}


I added the right click ability of the links, and a subsequent config option to restrict click/ctl+shift+click to just have the righ-click ability.

![image](/uploads/170dcff1a117b11d4fe50ba5eb027fba/image.png){width=719 height=600}

![image](/uploads/7240c7907e5612979ceefc589aeb10f5/image.png){width=719 height=600}

